Licenses of the Rust crates in the foch program
===============================================

Each foch release archive, PyPI wheel and WinGet package holds one executable,
statically linked from the foch-cli crate and the crates below for linux-x64,
darwin-arm64 and win32-x64. This file gives the license text each crate is used
under, with the crates that use that text. foch, foch-cli and
tree-sitter-paradox are Foch's own crates, described in NOTICE.md; every other
crate is third-party. Where a crate does not package its license file, the
license's standard text is shown, and the crate's repository names its
copyright holders.

